; bind.example.test: the independent signer of E33 (WP10.2). Signed per run by BIND's
; dnssec-keygen and dnssec-signzone in the bind container (recursion round, validation.sh);
; its DS goes into example.test on the authority node. The name server is bind.example.test
; itself, at 203.0.113.2.
$ORIGIN bind.example.test.
$TTL 300
@       IN SOA  bind.example.test. hostmaster.example.test. 1 3600 600 86400 60
@       IN NS   bind.example.test.
@       IN A    203.0.113.2
www     IN A    192.0.2.50
txt     IN TXT  "signed by BIND"
*.wild  IN A    192.0.2.51
